<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_tools">TplAppTools</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to generate menu items and actions for managing various tools within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for accessing tools like Git, Python, Composer, Ghostscript, Ngrok, Pear, Perl, Ruby and more. </para>
<para>
